# Dependency Version Alignment
RULE: Check codex and workspace-constraints.toml (Python) or workspace-constraints-node.json (Node/frontend) before adding/updating deps. Use version ranges from the appropriate SSOT.
WHY: Prevents import failures, test incompatibilities, deployment issues across 30+ repos.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/dependency-management.md, .cursor/workspace-configs/check-dependency-alignment.sh
DO: Update codex first if new dep; update ALL repos; run `uv lock`; run resolve-canonical-versions.py (validates via uv pip compile); use resolve-version-conflicts.py to detect drift
NEVER: Add dep without codex/workspace-constraints check; update one repo only; skip uv.lock
See also: `canonical-external-deps.mdc` (workspace-constraints SSOT); `uv-lock-file.mdc` — lock file mechanics.
